{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02917","headline":"示珦 · 陈元光","name":"示珦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"恩衔枫陛渥，策向桂渊弘。\n载笔沿儒习，持弓缵祖风。\n祛灾剿猛虎，溥德翊飞龙。\n日阅书开士，星言驾劝农。\n勤劳思命重，戏谑逐时空。\n百粤雾纷满，诸戎泽普通。\n愿言加壮努，勿坐鬓霜蓬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈元光","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02917.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02917","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}